@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Terms of Service & Atelier Agreement — SAT Jewel";
}

<div class="sat-legal-page-wrap">
    <!-- Header Banner -->
    <div class="sat-legal-banner">
        <div class="sat-legal-banner-inner">
            <span class="sat-legal-badge">Legal Governance</span>
            <h1 class="sat-legal-title">Terms of Service & Atelier Agreement</h1>
            <p class="sat-legal-subtitle">Terms governing the use of SAT Jewel online services, bespoke jewelry commissions, intellectual property, and transactional warranties.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="sat-legal-container">

        <!-- Acceptance of Terms -->
        <div class="sat-legal-card hero-highlight">
            <h2 class="sat-legal-heading"><i class="fa-solid fa-scale-balanced gold-icon"></i> Acceptance of Terms</h2>
            <p>By accessing satjewels.com, registering an account, or placing an order with SAT Jewel LLC ("Company", "we", "us"), you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agreed to be legally bound by these Terms of Service, along with our Privacy Policy, Refund Policy, and Shipping Policy.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Authenticity & Gemological Certification -->
        <div class="sat-legal-card">
            <h2 class="sat-legal-heading"><i class="fa-solid fa-gem gold-icon"></i> Authenticity & Gemological Certification</h2>
            <p>SAT Jewel warrants that all diamonds advertised as Lab-Grown Diamonds are 100% genuine CVD/HPHT diamonds possessing identical physical, optical, and chemical compositions to mined diamonds. Solitaires are accompanied by authentic digital or physical certificates issued by the Gemological Institute of America (GIA) or International Gemological Institute (IGI).</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Custom Orders & Specifications -->
        <div class="sat-legal-card">
            <h2 class="sat-legal-heading"><i class="fa-solid fa-hammer gold-icon"></i> Bespoke Commissions & Alterations</h2>
            <p>Because each fine jewelry piece is cast and hand-set to order based on your selected metal (10K, 14K, 18K Gold, 950 Platinum), carat weight, and ring size, customer specifications are locked upon CAD model approval. Changes requested after casting has commenced may incur material and labor fees.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Pricing & Errors -->
        <div class="sat-legal-card">
            <h2 class="sat-legal-heading"><i class="fa-solid fa-tag gold-icon"></i> Authoritative Pricing & Currency</h2>
            <p>All prices are listed in United States Dollars (USD) unless otherwise stated. While we make every effort to display accurate pricing, in the event of an inadvertent technical error or database mispricing, SAT Jewel reserves the right to cancel or refund the affected order prior to fulfillment.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Governing Law -->
        <div class="sat-legal-card">
            <h2 class="sat-legal-heading"><i class="fa-solid fa-landmark gold-icon"></i> Governing Law & Dispute Resolution</h2>
            <p>These Terms and any separate agreements whereby we provide you fine jewelry services shall be governed by and construed in accordance with applicable laws, with amicable resolution and arbitration as the preferred forum for any transactional dispute.</p>
        </div>

    </div>
</div>
